      "ftro:note": "The chain terminates one step in. ref_osc, interval, lag and weighting are OPTIONAL in the pinned format and ABSENT from all 12 comparisons, so no station time scale, oscillator or UTC(k) node can be named. The format's own second sentence places time transfer out of scope, so the gap is structurally permitted by it. FTRO-DEF-003.",
